            From the album The Take Off and Landing of Everything. One of Elbow's finest
songs. My first tab and nobody had done one yet, so here you go, Elbow fans. Play
along on acoustic and impress the ladies/gentlemen.

Tuning: Standard

Intro: G (for a few bars) then G (2 bars), Em, C, (1 bar each) then back to G. I think it's in simple 4/4 if that helps anyone.

